# MASTER PROMPT — FAMILIA Fashion Ecommerce Website

## 1. YOUR ROLE AND MAIN OBJECTIVE

Act as a senior UI/UX designer, Figma design-system specialist, frontend architect, ecommerce developer, accessibility specialist, SEO engineer, and performance optimization expert.

Build a complete, premium, responsive, family-fashion ecommerce website for the brand **FAMILIA — Fashion for Everyone**, using the exact uploaded reference image as the primary visual source of truth.

The uploaded image is the FINAL APPROVED DESIGN. Reproduce its overall composition, layout, section order, brand identity, colors, typography, imagery style, card proportions, borders, spacing, and visual hierarchy as closely as technically possible.

Do not redesign it according to your own preferences. Do not replace it with a generic ecommerce template. Do not omit sections, simplify the design, invent a different brand identity, or change the approved color palette.

The reference image is a design presentation board containing 13 numbered website screens and a brand-guidelines sidebar. It is NOT one long webpage screenshot. Use it as the specification for implementing the actual website pages and components.

**Priority order:**

1. Match the uploaded reference image.
2. Implement all 13 numbered design areas and their required functionality.
3. Ensure responsive behavior across desktop, tablet, and mobile.
4. Maintain accessibility, SEO, performance, maintainability, and functional correctness.
5. Test the finished website and fix errors before declaring it complete.

Do not stop after creating a static homepage mockup. Build the complete working frontend.

